{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39835","headline":"九华贺雨吟 · 殷文圭","name":"九华贺雨吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陶公焦思念生灵，变旱爲丰合杳冥。\n雷劈老松疑虎怒，雨冲阴洞觉龙腥。\n万畦香稻蓬葱绿，九朵奇峰扑亚青。\n吟贺西成饶旅兴，散丝飞洒满长亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}